# Bridge fixture: header-only project.
# Targets: a project header with no tasks. TaskJuggler stops scheduling with
# error no_tasks, which has no source location, so the message has file,
# line and column null. Expected: ok false; project info filled (timezone and
# version as written); tasks, resources and bookings empty.
project hdr "Header only" "0.9" 2026-03-02 +1m {
  timezone "Europe/Berlin"
  now 2026-03-02-09:00
}
